{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into the blood-soaked boots of Shevchenko, a battle-hardened nurse caught in the chaos of a zombie apocalypse.</strong><br>As the world crumbles, Shevchenko clings to one fragile hope \u2014 finding a cure. To do so, she must brave ruined cities, explore mysterious dungeons, and face off against grotesque undead nightmares. Survival is no guarantee. Curiosity is your only compass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this isn\u2019t just your average dungeon crawler. Between ambushes and scavenging, you\u2019ll also be answering delightfully absurd quizzes that <strong>reveal hidden sides of your personality</strong>\u2014even the ones you didn\u2019t know existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306960/extras/cc111.png?t=1752053041\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic turn-based dungeon-crawling RPG with a post-apocalyptic twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre personality quizzes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot, gear up, and face a terrifying variety of zombies and monsters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2306960?t=1752053041","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306960/5cd0e6a1c8700a7f1eba6a4126a363d1e77b2e06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752053041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306960/82b5add8ff63b7e9542643b63557f76648a0486b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752053041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306960/82b5add8ff63b7e9542643b63557f76648a0486b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752053041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom V